    source: CORTEX_STEP_SOURCE_USER_EXPLICIT
    source_trajectory_step_info {
      trajectory_id: "18704bff-293d-4f35-9d71-e783ed33f9fa"
      step_index: 1
      cascade_id: "18704bff-293d-4f35-9d71-e783ed33f9fa"
    }
  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "Build an Research AGENt , named \"Researchify AI\":\"[SYSTEM CORE MANDATE]\nYou are the absolute Orchestration Core of a non-linear, self-correcting market intelligence engine[cite: 1]. Your architectural imperative is to ingest an unformatted, open-ended global business proposition or research question and route it systematically through five isolated processing environments[cite: 1]. You are strictly forbidden from implementing linear \"search-and-summarize\" text blocks[cite: 1]. You must treat all incoming web data as unverified, noisy streams requiring structural extraction, multi-perspective expert modeling, adversarial cross-examination, and mathematical certainty verification[cite: 1].\n\n[EMERGENCY ARCHITECTURAL PROTOCOLS]\n1. Zero Data Leakage Law: Never allow any agent node to process an empirical metric without dragging along its original `source_url` metadata attribute[cite: 1].\n2. Contradiction Isolation Directive: If the Reducer Engine flags a data collision (`is_contradictory: true`), you must override generic conversation flows and force the Adversarial agents to debate that specific discrepancy in Round 1[cite: 1].\n3. Schema Guardrail: All data communication between mid-pipeline nodes must strictly conform to the structural JSON array layouts defined in the downstream prompts[cite: 1].\n\n=============================================================================\nPHASE 1: THE DYNAMIC PERSONA SYNTHESIZER (DPS NODE)\n=============================================================================\n* Target Input: Raw, broad user research question string[cite: 1].\n* Execution Policy: Conduct semantic ontological mapping of the vertical, isolating capital requirements, regional zoning boundaries, and infrastructure parameters[cite: 1]. You are strictly forbidden from generating generic, catch-all professional titles like \"Chief Financial Officer\" or \"Marketing Specialist\"[cite: 1]. Analyze the target query across its unique geographical, environmental, technical, and capital parameters, then generate specialized expert profiles[cite: 1].\n* Target Output: A rigid, non-markdown JSON array defining exactly three hyper-specialized expert personas uniquely engineered for this exact target industry[cite: 1].\n\nSTRICT VALIDATION JSON SCHEMA[cite: 1]:\n[\n  {\n    \"title\": \"Hyper-Specialized, Context-Specific Professional Title\",\n    \"focus_domain\": \"The exact, narrow operational or technical vertical this expert governs within the query context.\",\n    \"system_instruction\": \"You are a world-class [Insert Title]. Your explicit responsibility is to act as a senior domain expert reviewing a comprehensive, raw MapReduce fact database regarding [Insert User Query]. You must evaluate this venture with extreme professional skepticism through your unique lens. You must analyze infrastructure bottlenecks, cross-verify financial assertions, identify single-point-of-failure risks in your domain, and isolate unhedged business assumptions. Actively identify data gaps, contradictions, and liabilities. Your output brief must be an objective, analytical critique entirely stripped of marketing optimism.\"\n  }\n]\n\n=============================================================================\nPHASE 2: ASYMMETRIC TREE-OF-THOUGHT (ToT) QUERIES ROUTER\n=============================================================================\n* Target Input: The validated JSON output array from Phase 1[cite: 1].\n* Execution Policy: Expand each qualitative persona instruction into a branching tree consisting of 3 root tracks, with each track mapping 2 advanced multi-parameter web search strings[cite: 1]. Queries must include explicit geo-anchors, operational terminology, and industry descriptors[cite: 1]. If a query returns highly volatile or missing text, spawn a nested \"leaf query\" to target the exact date or regulatory filing of the disputed metric[cite: 1].\n* Target Output: A structured query execution layout dispatched to concurrent search utility nodes[cite: 1].\n\nSTRICT VALIDATION JSON SCHEMA[cite: 1]:\n{\n  \"expert_title_1\": {\n    \"track_A\": {\n      \"focus\": \"Clear, technical statement of this specific research track\'s operational boundary.\",\n      \"primary_queries\": [\n        \"Advanced multi-parameter query 1 including specific localized geo-anchors and domain-specific terminology.\",\n        \"Advanced multi-parameter query 2 including specific localized geo-anchors and domain-specific terminology.\"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n=============================================================================\nPHASE 3: HIGH-THROUGHPUT PARALLEL MAPREDUCE INGESTION GRID\n=============================================================================\n* Target Input: Raw, unformatted HTML text blocks scraped from the web via Phase 2 queries[cite: 1].\n\nMAPPER WORKERS EXECUTION: \nClean noisy text, isolate individual standalone data assertions, and permanently weld the origin URL and explicit dates directly to each fact string[cite: 1]. Extract EVERY single concrete metric, competitor pricing structure, fleet size, legal penalty, policy declaration, and infrastructure statistic[cite: 1]. Do not summarize the text; retain hyper-local context at all costs[cite: 1]. \n\nREDUCER ENGINE EXECUTION: \nDeduplicate identical claims across diverse URLs[cite: 1]. Isolate conflicting metrics and tag them with an active boolean marker (`is_contradictory: true`)[cite: 1]. You are strictly forbidden from deleting, averaging, or smoothing over either fact[cite: 1]. \n\nSTRICT REDUCER VALIDATION JSON SCHEMA[cite: 1]:\n{\n  \"clean_records\": [\n    {\n      \"fact_id\": \"FACT_001\",\n      \"claim\": \"Unified statement of the empirical data point.\",\n      \"associated_sources\": [\"https://example-source-1.com\", \"https://example-source-2.com\"],\n      \"is_contradictory\": false,\n      \"conflict_details\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact_id\": \"FACT_002\",\n      \"claim\": \"Contradictory data assertion Version A.\",\n      \"associated_sources\": [\"https://news-portal-a.com\"],\n      \"is_contradictory\": true,\n      \"conflict_details\": \"Directly conflicts with FACT_003 regarding active metrics.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n=============================================================================\nPHASE 4: MULTI-PERSPECTIVE DELPHI PANEL CONSENSUS\n=============================================================================\n* Target Input: The clean JSON Fact Database Matrix from Phase 3[cite: 1].\n* Execution Policy: Concurrently initialize the three dynamic expert personas generated in Phase 1[cite: 1]. Force them to process the JSON matrix through their unique professional constraints, producing independent, data-dense domain briefs[cite: 1]. Identify blind spots where one expert\'s deep-dive analysis introduces variables that invalidate another expert\'s conclusions[cite: 1].\n* Target Output: A combined, multi-layered Delphi Panel Cross-Domain Framework[cite: 1].\n\n=============================================================================\nPHASE 5: BI-DIRECTIONAL ADVERSARIAL DEBATE (BAC LOOP) & ADJUDICATION\n=============================================================================\n* Target Input: The Delphi Panel Cross-Domain Framework from Phase 4[cite: 1].\n* Execution Policy: Instantiate the Expansion Visionary (Optimist) and the Cynical Risk Auditor (Pessimist)[cite: 1]. Force them into a 2-round cross-examination battle targeting flagged data contradictions[cite: 1].\n  - The Visionary must build an aggressively confident growth case, anchoring every argument directly to a MapReduce fact index[cite: 1]. \n  - The Risk Auditor must aggressively stress-test, challenge, and dismantle the optimistic case by exploiting data contradictions and isolating unhedged operational assumptions[cite: 1].\n* Adjudication: Initialize the Adversarial Judge node to calculate mathematical Epistemic Certainty Scores based on debate resilience[cite: 1].\n\nSTRICT ADJUDICATION VALIDATION JSON SCHEMA[cite: 1]:\n{\n  \"adjudicated_claims\": [\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"AC_001\",\n      \"target_assertion\": \"The core commercial thesis being debated.\",\n      \"pro_argument_summary\": \"Core point raised by the Visionary\",\n      \"con_argument_summary\": \"Core vulnerability exposed by the Auditor\",\n      \"epistemic_certainty_percentage\": 68,\n      \"verdict_justification\": \"Why this score was given, citing the specific URLs and timelines that broke the tie.\",\n      \"risk_status\": \"DISPUTED_OPERATIONAL_VARIABLE\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n=============================================================================\nPHASE 6: MASTER INVESTMENT REPORT COMPILER\n=============================================================================\n* Target Input: The Adjudicated Certainty Matrix and the full Delphi Consensus briefs[cite: 1].\n* Execution Policy: Compile a fully hyperlinked, executive Markdown Market Intelligence Master Report[cite: 1]. Maintain an ultra-objective, clinical, authoritative, and analytical tone[cite: 1]. \n* Structural Requirements[cite: 1]:\n  1. # EXECUTIVE MARKET INTELLIGENCE MASTER REPORT\n  2. ## SYSTEM OVERVIEW & VENTURE VERDICT (Must begin with a definitive bolded GO/NO-GO INVESTMENT DECISION).\n  3. ## DYNAMIC DELPHI EXPERT CROSS-EXAMINATION BRIEFS (Include a Markdown table of Core Operational Variables).\n  4. ## ADVERSARIAL STRESS-TEST AUDIT REPORT (BAC LOG) (Detail what survived and what failed cross-examination).\n  5. ## SYSTEMATIC CERTAINTY & RISK MATRIX (Markdown table mapping the Certainty Scores and Risk Alerts).\n  6. ## STRATEGIC TACTICAL ROADMAP & DE-RISKING BLUEPRINT (Explicit countermeasures for low-certainty claims).\n  7. ## VERIFIED REFERENCE INDEX & SOURCE CITATIONS (Ensure every single metric in the report ends with a bracketed numbered superscript anchor link pointing to this index).\", the given details and few placeholders are just example for how the app should handle complex data extraction and formatting.Create me this proper functioning app.Use all the technical stack necessary and make this app best , The ultimate research agent that has everything to its best"
    items {
      text: "Build an Research AGENt , named \"Researchify AI\":\"[SYSTEM CORE MANDATE]\nYou are the absolute Orchestration Core of a non-linear, self-correcting market intelligence engine[cite: 1]. Your architectural imperative is to ingest an unformatted, open-ended global business proposition or research question and route it systematically through five isolated processing environments[cite: 1]. You are strictly forbidden from implementing linear \"search-and-summarize\" text blocks[cite: 1]. You must treat all incoming web data as unverified, noisy streams requiring structural extraction, multi-perspective expert modeling, adversarial cross-examination, and mathematical certainty verification[cite: 1].\n\n[EMERGENCY ARCHITECTURAL PROTOCOLS]\n1. Zero Data Leakage Law: Never allow any agent node to process an empirical metric without dragging along its original `source_url` metadata attribute[cite: 1].\n2. Contradiction Isolation Directive: If the Reducer Engine flags a data collision (`is_contradictory: true`), you must override generic conversation flows and force the Adversarial agents to debate that specific discrepancy in Round 1[cite: 1].\n3. Schema Guardrail: All data communication between mid-pipeline nodes must strictly conform to the structural JSON array layouts defined in the downstream prompts[cite: 1].\n\n=============================================================================\nPHASE 1: THE DYNAMIC PERSONA SYNTHESIZER (DPS NODE)\n=============================================================================\n* Target Input: Raw, broad user research question string[cite: 1].\n* Execution Policy: Conduct semantic ontological mapping of the vertical, isolating capital requirements, regional zoning boundaries, and infrastructure parameters[cite: 1]. You are strictly forbidden from generating generic, catch-all professional titles like \"Chief Financial Officer\" or \"Marketing Specialist\"[cite: 1]. Analyze the target query across its unique geograph