  planner_response {
    response: "### Researchify AI \342\200\224 Self-Correcting Market Intelligence Engine\n\n**Researchify AI** has been designed and implemented as an orchestration core for non-linear, self-correcting market intelligence. It routes complex business propositions through five isolated processing environments, strictly replacing linear summarization with structural extraction, tree-of-thought routing, multi-perspective expert modeling, adversarial cross-examination, and mathematical certainty adjudication.\n\n---\n\n### Core Architectural Implementation\n\n1. **Protocol 1 \342\200\224 Zero Data Leakage Law**:\n   - Every empirical data point is welded to its origin `source_url`, category, and explicit date anchor. Data points cannot traverse between pipeline nodes without retaining provenance.\n\n2. **Protocol 2 \342\200\224 Contradiction Isolation Directive**:\n   - When the Reducer Engine detects conflicting empirical metrics across web streams (`is_contradictory: true`), it is strictly forbidden from averaging or smoothing the data. Instead, it flags the contradiction and forces the Adversarial agents to cross-examine that specific discrepancy in Round 1.\n\n3. **Protocol 3 \342\200\224 Strict Schema Guardrails**:\n   - Data between nodes adheres strictly to rigid JSON schemas validated at each step.\n\n---\n\n### Five Isolated Processing Environments + Compiler\n\n- **Phase 1: Dynamic Persona Synthesizer (DPS Node)**\n  - Synthesizes exactly three hyper-specialized expert profiles uniquely engineered for the operational vertical (e.g. *Infrastructure Bottleneck & Grid Interconnection Architect*, *Techno-Economic Arbitrage & CAPEX Forensics Lead*, *Statutory Regulatory Compliance Counsel*), explicitly rejecting generic professional titles.\n  \n- **Phase 2: Asymmetric Tree-of-Thought (ToT) Queries Router**\n  - Expands each expert persona into 3 root tracks, each dispatching 2 multi-parameter search strings with geo-anchors, operational terminology, and nested leaf queries targeting volatile regulatory filings and date-anchored metrics.\n\n- **Phase 3: High-Throughput Parallel MapReduce Ingestion Grid**\n  - **Mapper Workers**: Scrape live web intel (using Gemini with Google Search Grounding), extract concrete metrics (CAPEX, cycle times, throughput, dBA limits), and weld origin URLs.\n  - **Reducer Engine & Collision Radar**: Deduplicates claims while isolating contradictory records with detailed conflict specifications.\n\n- **Phase 4: Multi-Perspective Delphi Panel Consensus**\n  - Concurrently initializes the 3 dynamic experts to audit the MapReduce fact database, producing:\n    - Independent domain critiques, infrastructure bottlenecks, financial stress points, single-point-of-failure risks, and unhedged assumptions.\n    - An interactive **Core Operational Variables Table**.\n    - A **Cross-Domain Blind Spots Matrix** where one expert\'s deep-dive findings introduce operational variables that invalidate another expert\'s conclusions.\n\n- **Phase 5: Bi-Directional Adversarial Debate (BAC Loop) & Adjudication**\n  - Enforces a 2-round cross-examination battle between the **Expansion Visionary** (Optimist) and the **Cynical Risk Auditor** (Pessimist) anchored to MapReduce fact IDs.\n  - An **Adversarial Judge Node** calculates mathematical **Epistemic Certainty Scores (0\342\200\223100%)**, assigns risk statuses (`DISPUTED_OPERATIONAL_VARIABLE`, `HIGH_CERTAINTY_VERIFIED`, `CRITICAL_UNHEDGED_RISK`, `REGULATORY_FATAL_FLAW`), and issues an adjudicated **GO / CONDITIONAL GO / NO-GO** investment verdict.\n\n- **Phase 6: Master Investment Report Compiler**\n  - Compiles an executive 7-part Markdown report with:\n    1. `# EXECUTIVE MARKET INTELLIGENCE MASTER REPORT`\n    2. `## SYSTEM OVERVIEW & VENTURE VERDICT` (Definitive bolded decision)\n    3. `## DYNAMIC DELPHI EXPERT CROSS-EXAMINATION BRIEFS` (Core Operational Variables table)\n    4. `## ADVERSARIAL STRESS-TEST AUDIT REPORT (BAC LOG)`\n    5. `## SYSTEMATIC CERTAINTY & RISK MATRIX`\n    6. `## STRATEGIC TACTICAL ROADMAP & DE-RISKING BLUEPRINT`\n    7. `## VERIFIED REFERENCE INDEX & SOURCE CITATIONS` (`[^1]` footnote anchor links)\n\n---\n\n### Interactive Capabilities\n- **Execution Modes**: Launch via **Autonomous Blitz** (real-time Server-Sent Events stream) or audit via **Step-by-Step Cadence**.\n- **High-Conviction Benchmark Presets**: Instant launch of calibrated propositions (eVTOL corridors in NYC, Sodium-Ion storage in ERCOT, Robotic micro-pharmacies in the EU).\n- **Inspection & Export**: Full telemetry stream, raw Markdown copy, PDF print formatting, and complete JSON pipeline dossier downloads."
