    combined_output {
      full: "Parsed items: [  {    \"title\": \"ERCOT BESS Revenue Leaderboard, every battery ranked | Amperical\",    \"url\": \"https://amperical.ai/ercot-leaderboard/\",    \"snippet\": \"Every ERCOT battery storage resource ranked by revenue per kW-month from public settlement data. Top earning BESS projects, all 312 ranks public, updated daily by Amperical.\"  },  {    \"title\": \"ERCOT Batteries Shifting from Supply to Demand\",    \"url\": \"https://insight.factset.com/ercot-batteries-shifting-from-supply-to-demand\",    \"snippet\": \"ERCOT has commissioned 11.3 GW of battery storage to date, accounting for nearly 27% of all operational BESS capacity in the United States. While this figure remains modest relative to ERCOT&#x27;s renewable generation fleet, batteries are playing an increasingly important role in grid supply.\"  },  {    \"title\": \"ERCOT Buildout Report: Battery capacity crosses 12 GW in Q3 2025\",    \"url\": \"https://modoenergy.com/research/en/ercot-battery-buildout-report-q3-2025\",    \"snippet\": \"2 GW of battery storage came online in ERCOT in Q3 2025 - a record quarter for the market. Total capacity now stands at 12.5 GW - learn what happens next.\"  },  {    \"title\": \"ERCOT Annual Buildout Report: Battery capacity reaches 14 GW entering ...\",    \"url\": \"https://modoenergy.com/research/en/ercot-battery-buildout-2025-annual-report\",    \"snippet\": \"Texas begins 2026 with 13.9 GW and 22.9 GWh of commercially operational grid-scale BESS capacity. This represents a near-doubling of the fleet in a single year, with 6 GW of new capacity coming online in 2025 alone. Free guide from Modo Energy Putting AI to work in energy investment and asset management Following ERCOT battery buildout? A practical playbook for using AI tools across your ...\"  },  {    \"title\": \"ERCOT&#x27;s Battery Storage Boom: A Strategic Opportunity for Utilities ...\",    \"url\": \"https://www.yesenergy.com/blog/ercots-battery-storage-boom\",    \"snippet\": \"The Electric Reliability Council of Texas (ERCOT) is undergoing a transformative shift, with battery energy storage systems (BESS) emerging as a pivotal component of the state&#x27;s energy mix. As renewable energy generation reaches record levels, ERCOT energy storage is helping stabilize the grid, reduce costs, and improve reliability during peak demand. One of the fastest-growing battery storage ...\"  },  {    \"title\": \"Battery Energy Storage - Electric Reliability Council of Texas\",    \"url\": \"https://www.ercot.com/mktrules/keypriorities/bes\",    \"snippet\": \"A Battery Energy Storage Task Force was established in 2019 to identify key topics and concepts for the integration of Energy Storage Resources in ERCOT. The task force is developing Nodal Protocol Revision Requests (NPRRs) that will address technical requirements, modeling needs and market rules for these resources. The policy recommendations can be found in this section.\"  },  {    \"title\": \"PDF ERCOT Monthly\",    \"url\": \"https://www.ercot.com/files/docs/2025/08/06/ERCOT-Monthly-July-2025.pdf\",    \"snippet\": \"Over the past several years, the ERCOT grid has seen a considerable expansion in battery energy storage systems (BESSs), with installed capacity reaching 14,137 MW as of July 2025.\"  },  {    \"title\": \"Aurora&#x27;s ERCOT BESS Report 2025: Battery Deployment Trends\",    \"url\": \"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/jaydecunzo_ercot-battery-performance-in-2025-preview-activity-7402085448518582272-WmhL\",    \"snippet\": \"Great insights in Aurora&#x27;s latest #ERCOT BESS report, retrospective for 2025! Battery deployment has continued surging and revenues are under pressure, shaping how projects pivot from ancillary ...\"  }]"
    }
    command_line: "node -e \"\nasync function searchWeb(q) {\n  const res = await fetch(\'https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=\' + encodeURIComponent(q), {\n    headers: { \'User-Agent\': \'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64)\' }\n  });\n  const html = await res.text();\n  const items = [];\n  const regex = /<h2 class=\\\"result__title\\\">[\\s\\S]*?<a rel=\\\"nofollow\\\" class=\\\"result__a\\\" href=\\\"([^\\\"]*uddg=([^\\\"]*?)(&|&amp;)[^\\\"]*)\\\"[^>]*>([\\s\\S]*?)<\\/a>[\\s\\S]*?<a class=\\\"result__snippet[^\\\"]*\\\"[^>]*>([\\s\\S]*?)<\\/a>/g;\n  let match;\n  while ((match = regex.exec(html)) !== null && items.length < 8) {\n    const rawUrl = decodeURIComponent(match[2]);\n    const title = match[4].replace(/<[^>]+>/g, \'\').trim();\n    const snippet = match[5].replace(/<[^>]+>/g, \'\').trim();\n    if (rawUrl.startsWith(\'http\')) {\n      items.push({ title, url: rawUrl, snippet });\n    }\n  }\n  return items;\n}\nsearchWeb(\'ERCOT Sodium Ion battery BESS 2025\').then(r => console.log(\'Parsed items:\', JSON.stringify(r, null, 2)));\n\""
