g the battery boom. The Electric Reliability Council of Texas (ERCOT) grid already hosts more utility-scale battery capacity than most countries, and developers keep flocking to build more. What makes this market so attractive? Below is a plain-English tour of the forces turning the Lone Star State into the capital of giant grid batteries\342\200\224and what that ..."
    }
    command_line: "node -e \"\nfetch(\'https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=Sodium+Ion+battery+utility+scale+ERCOT\', {\n  headers: { \'User-Agent\': \'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/120.0.0.0 Safari/537.36\' }\n})\n.then(r => r.text())\n.then(html => {\n  const titles = [];\n  const urls = [];\n  const snippets = [];\n\n  // Match title links\n  const titleRegex = /<a rel=\\\"nofollow\\\" class=\\\"result__a\\\" href=\\\"([^\\\"]+)\\\"[^>]*>([\\s\\S]*?)<\\/a>/g;\n  let m;\n  while ((m = titleRegex.exec(html)) !== null) {\n    const rawHref = m[1];\n    const title = m[2].replace(/<[^>]+>/g, \'\').trim();\n    let url = rawHref;\n    if (rawHref.includes(\'uddg=\')) {\n      const uMatch = rawHref.match(/uddg=([^&]+)/);\n      if (uMatch) url = decodeURIComponent(uMatch[1]);\n    }\n    if (url.startsWith(\'http\') && !url.includes(\'duckduckgo.com\')) {\n      titles.push(title);\n      urls.push(url);\n    }\n  }\n\n  // Match snippets\n  const snippetRegex = /<a class=\\\"result__snippet[^\\\"]*\\\"[^>]*>([\\s\\S]*?)<\\/a>/g;\n  while ((m = snippetRegex.exec(html)) !== null) {\n    snippets.push(m[1].replace(/<[^>]+>/g, \'\').trim());\n  }\n\n  console.log(\'Found titles:\', titles.length, \'snippets:\', snippets.length);\n  for (let i = 0; i < Math.min(titles.length, 5); i++) {\n    console.log(i + 1, \'Title:\', titles[i]);\n    console.log(\'   URL:\', urls[i]);\n    console.log(\'   Snippet:\', snippets[i] || \'N/A\');\n  }\n});\n\""
