    thinking: "**Considering Air Taxi Market**\n\nI\'m now diving into the live news aspect, having reviewed Joby Aviation, Archer Aviation, and the general air taxi concept. My focus is shifting towards current events and market dynamics. I\'m keen to find out how recent news impacts this field.\n\n\n**Analyzing News Extraction Methods**\n\nI\'m now deep in the weeds of news extraction techniques. I\'ve realized Google News RSS provides a canonical redirect link *and* the original source URL. I\'m exploring how to best utilize both \342\200\223 direct Google News links and the publisher\'s URLs. I\'m also cross-referencing this approach with Hacker News Algolia\'s data to validate my findings.\n\n\n**Combining Research Databases**\n\nI\'m now integrating OpenAlex, HackerNews, and Wikipedia into a unified system. My goal is to create a robust research harvester in Node. I\'m focusing on pulling real URLs, like DOI links from OpenAlex and direct publisher URLs from HackerNews. I will begin by working on combining the three sources.\n\n\n"
